OL,3,GNEWSA'My autistic son and I feel
OL,4,Aabandoned and failed by the system'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother has said she feels her son has
OL,7,Fbeen "abandoned and is falling through
OL,8,Fcracks in the system" because of a lack
OL,9,Fof support for young adults with
OL,10,Flearning difficulties.
OL,12,FCherrise Lanigan's son Callan has
OL,13,Fautism and Attention Deficit
OL,14,FHyperactivity Disorder (ADHD), as well
OL,15,Fas anxiety and other behavioural
OL,16,Fissues.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
