OL,1,W5j 5Q7k jjs%wsj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'My autistic son and I feel
OL,4,Aabandoned and failed by the system'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe recently turned 18 but cannot access
OL,7,Fadult disability services because of
OL,8,Fthe way health trusts assess support
OL,9,Fneeds using an IQ test. Cherisse
OL,10,Fbelieves it is a flawed system that is
OL,11,Fdisadvantaging her son.
OL,13,FThe Northern Health Trust has said it
OL,14,Frecognises the approach "can present
OL,15,Fsignificant challenges" for individuals
OL,16,Fand families who do not meet the
OL,17,Feligibility criteria.
